# IronQuill — D&D Adventure Manager

A web app that augments tabletop D&D sessions. Helps DMs run adventures and players manage characters. Does NOT replace physical dice or tabletop interaction.

## Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Frontend | React 19, TypeScript, Vite, TanStack Router, TanStack Query, Zustand, CSS Modules |
| Backend | Node.js 22 LTS, Fastify, TypeScript, Drizzle ORM, Socket.io |
| Database | PostgreSQL 16 |
| Shared | Zod schemas + TypeScript types in `packages/shared` |
| Storage | Cloudflare R2 via `@aws-sdk/client-s3` |
| Hosting | Railway (API + DB) + Cloudflare Pages (frontend) |
| Linting / Formatting | Biome (replaces ESLint + Prettier) — single `biome.json` at repo root |

## Repository Structure

```
ironquill/
├── apps/
│   ├── web/src/
│   │   ├── components/     # Shared UI components
│   │   ├── features/       # Feature modules: character/, adventure/, session/, srd/
│   │   ├── hooks/          # Shared custom hooks
│   │   ├── routes/         # TanStack Router route files
│   │   ├── stores/         # Zustand stores
│   │   ├── services/       # TanStack Query keys + API fetchers
│   │   └── styles/         # Global CSS tokens, resets
│   └── api/src/
│       ├── db/             # Drizzle schema, migrations, seed
│       ├── plugins/        # Fastify plugins (auth, websocket, cors)
│       ├── routes/         # Route handlers by domain
│       ├── services/       # Business logic (framework-agnostic)
│       └── lib/            # Utilities (storage, tokens, errors)
└── packages/
    └── shared/src/
        ├── schemas/        # Zod validation schemas (source of truth)
        └── types/          # Types derived from Zod with z.infer<>
```

## Naming Conventions

| Thing | Convention | Example |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Files / folders | kebab-case | `character-sheet.tsx` |
| Components | PascalCase | `CharacterSheet` |
| Hooks | camelCase, use prefix | `useCharacter` |
| Constants | SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_PARTY_SIZE` |
| CSS class names | camelCase (CSS Modules) | `.cardActive` |
| DB tables | snake_case | `srd_monsters` |
| DB columns | snake_case | `ability_scores` |
| Zod schemas | PascalCase + Schema suffix | `CharacterCreateSchema` |
| TypeScript types | PascalCase | `Character`, `AdventureStatus` |
